    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom>
                    <owl:Class>
                        <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017"/>
                        </owl:unionOf>
                    </owl:Class>
                </owl:someValuesFrom>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind characteristics determination method is a methodology with the goal to understand the specific wind characteristics of a predefined region, encompassing data acquisition, modelling, and analytical procedures.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind characteristics determination method</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1966

Axiom update:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2004
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2005</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Data preparation is an action specification that describes the steps the bearer takes to acquire raw data and how this data is cleaned, transformed, and structured for subsequent analysis. So it includes the acquisition and pre-processing of data.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">data preparation</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Determined wind characteristics is an object specification that defines the goal of a methodology as a state of understanding the specific wind characteristics of a predefined region.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">determined wind characteristics</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1966</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind speed calculation is an action specification that describes how wind speed at the hub height of a wind turbine is inferred from measurements taken at a different height. It is extrapolated vertically to the hub height.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind speed calculation</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390026"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind characteristics determination process is a process that follows a determination methodology for wind characteristics to gain knowledge of the specific wind characteristics of a predefined region.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind characteristics determination process</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1966</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Air density adjustment is an action specification that describes how variations in air density due to changes in altitude, temperature, and pressure are incorporated into the wind resource calculations.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">air density adjustment</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind speed frequency analysis is an action specification that describes the process of calculating the frequency of different wind speed intervals over a set period giving a wind speed frequency distribution.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind speed frequency analysis</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind variability identification is an action specification that describes the process of identifying variations in wind characteristics across temporal scales.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind variability identification</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1966</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind power density calculation is an action specification that describes how wind power density (WPD) is calculated to estimate the theoretical wind power potential based on wind speed and air density.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">wpd calculation</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind power density calculation</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1964</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Improve spatial resolution is an action specification that describes the process of increasing the spatial resolution of wind data across a region to provide finer detail for wind resource assessment. This is done by horizontal interpolation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improve spatial resolution</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Select exclusion criteria is an action specification that describes the process of defining physical, environmental, and regulatory criteria that exclude areas from wind farm development, along with the application of buffer zones.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">select exclusion criteria</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Prepare exclusion criteria datasets is an action specification that describes the steps involved in obtaining and preparing datasets that represent exclusion zones for wind farm development, based on predefined criteria. That includes acquiring and processing the data.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">prepare exclusion criteria datasets</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Run multi-criteria secision analysis is an action specification that describes how a multi-criteria decision analysis (MCDA) method is applied to areas where exclusions are not absolute (soft exclusion criteria), allowing for weighted decision-making.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">run MCDA</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">run multi-criteria decision analysis</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1964</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Determine development area is an action specification that describes the identification of potential areas where wind farm development is feasible, by iteratively excluding non-available areas based on the processed data and exclusion criteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">determine development area</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Determine geographical potential is an action specification that describes the calculation of the total geographical area available for wind farm development after applying exclusion criteria and considering spatial constraints.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">determine geographical potential</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Determined wind farm area is an object specification that defines the goal of a methodology as a state of understanding the available area for wind farm development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">determined wind farm area</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom>
                    <owl:Class>
                        <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031"/>
                            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032"/>
                        </owl:unionOf>
                    </owl:Class>
                </owl:someValuesFrom>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wind farm area determination method is a methodology with the goal of identifying and quantifying the area suitable for wind farm development, based on topographical, environmental, and regulatory constraints.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">wind farm area determination method</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940

Axiom update:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2004
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2005</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Action specification for wind characteristics is an action specification that deals with wind characteristics.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">action specification for wind characteristics</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
