        <obo:IAO_0000115>Place turbines within area is an action specification that describes the definition of the spatial arrangement of wind turbines within the designated area, ensuring optimal positioning based on site characteristics and layout constraints.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">place turbines within area</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
