        <obo:IAO_0000115>Account for wake losses is an action specification that describes the inclusion of losses due to wind turbine wake effects, which reduce wind speed and energy yield behind turbines.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">account for wake losses</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
