        <obo:IAO_0000115>Determine annual energy yield is an action specification that describes how a turbine&apos;s power curve is combined with the wind speed distribution to calculate the expected annual energy production.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">determine annual energy yield</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1940</oeo:OEO_00020426>
    </owl:Class>
    


