        <obo:IAO_0000115>Determine capacity factor is an action specification that describes the calculation of the capacity factor (CF), which represents the ratio of actual energy output to the maximum possible output over a given time period.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">determine capacity factor</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>Add:
