        <obo:IAO_0000115>Calculate technical potential is an action specification that describes how the total energy production capability of the available area is determined, factoring in turbine placement, capacity density, and wake losses.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">calculate technical potential</rdfs:label>
